sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server

    note over C,S: TCP Three-Way Handshake
    C->>S: SYN
    S->>C: SYN-ACK
    C->>S: ACK

    note over C,S: HTTP Request/Response
    C->>S: GET /resource HTTP/1.1
    C->>S: Host: example.com
    C->>S: Accept: text/html
    C->>S: Connection: keep-alive

    S->>C: HTTP/1.1 200 OK
    S->>C: Content-Type: text/html
    S->>C: Content-Length: 1234
    S->>C: [Response Body]

    note over C,S: Connection remains open for reuse
